 "why_floorplan": "R0-only lattice candidate. Preserves source RTL, child LEF and SRAM macro origins; reach/clock diagnostic must reject if longer input/output paths exceed405um. No waiver inferred from RX face waiver.",
 "slot_change_request": "compute-die contract v1.2 slot (el1014-qwen-split-compute.log 22:10): S IO band 3,453.4 x 1,563.8 R0 @ x 12,468 y 22 -> this cluster 864 x 950.4 (0.821 mm2) inside it; band order serdes_2 | serdes_1 | collective | serdes | ucie: faces W = SerDes 1/2, E = SerDes 0 + UCIe, N = core (seq_su cmd / in, out).",
 "structural_change": "DRAFT diagnostic core rekit: fixed LU53/LS378; all eight immutable fold children R0 on43.2um lattice (pre-fold X604.8 instead of MY X600.456). MY at any lattice X has two M5 pin centers24nm offtrack; R0 all645 pins legal. Full-width soft band y907.2..950.4; pin grouping and physical reaches/TTFF clock pending. Two-edge boundary reset guard, no data stages. Not a production view or release qualification.",
